WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:06.330
We have some very interesting new polling
from these early days of the Joe Biden administration.

00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:11.770
And sixty nine percent of Americans approve
of Joe Biden's week one covid response.

00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:17.330
And if you know anything about the hyper partizan
and politicized, divided nature of the United

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:21.680
States, 69 percent of Americans agreeing about
anything is pretty remarkable.

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:24.150
And there are even better numbers than that.

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:28.250
This is an ABC News Ipsos poll released yesterday.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:33.510
69 percent of Americans support Joe Biden's
covid-19 response.

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:39.769
Thus far, that's 97 percent of Democrats,
70 percent of independents.

00:00:39.769 --> 00:00:47.019
But very interestingly, almost half of Republicans,
40 percent of Republicans approve of the way

00:00:47.019 --> 00:00:50.850
Joe Biden so far has handled coronavirus.

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:58.979
Now, in comparison, the highest approval rate
that Trump ever had on the pandemic was 55

00:00:58.979 --> 00:00:59.979
percent.

00:00:59.979 --> 00:01:00.979
But when was it?

00:01:00.979 --> 00:01:01.979
It was mid-March.

00:01:01.979 --> 00:01:02.979
What did Trump done in mid-March?

00:01:02.979 --> 00:01:07.640
I think it was March 12th or 15th that Trump
said were shutting down travel from China

00:01:07.640 --> 00:01:09.049
or Europe.

00:01:09.049 --> 00:01:11.530
That was his high point of 55 percent.

00:01:11.530 --> 00:01:13.210
And it's only been down from there.

00:01:13.210 --> 00:01:18.780
Joe Biden already at 69 percent approval on
coronavirus.

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:20.950
What is he done so far that people approve
of?

00:01:20.950 --> 00:01:23.900
Well, on day one, he did sign the executive
orders.

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:29.409
He promised to sign the federal facemask mandate
at federal buildings and on transportation,

00:01:29.409 --> 00:01:31.179
et cetera.

00:01:31.179 --> 00:01:38.229
He also put together a number of other specific
plans which are yet to be voted on in terms

00:01:38.229 --> 00:01:41.729
of coronavirus stimulus, vaccine distribution.

00:01:41.729 --> 00:01:47.390
And much, much more interestingly, the mask
mandate has 81 percent support across the

00:01:47.390 --> 00:01:50.329
country, 81 percent support.

00:01:50.329 --> 00:01:55.060
And Joe Biden also importantly stopped the
American withdrawal from the World Health

00:01:55.060 --> 00:02:00.439
Organization immediately putting Dr. Anthony
Fauci is the sort of liaison or spokesperson

00:02:00.439 --> 00:02:07.090
for the U.S. in the rekindled relationship
with the WHL. 70 percent of Americans also

00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:13.060
agree with getting back into or halting our
exit from the W.H.

00:02:13.060 --> 00:02:17.250
Oh, this is a really, really big deal.

00:02:17.250 --> 00:02:23.420
And the reason it's a big deal is that, again,
in this country, it's really hard to get numbers

00:02:23.420 --> 00:02:25.209
that high on anything.

00:02:25.209 --> 00:02:32.680
If you you know, we've talked before on presidential
approval, you have probably 20 percent of

00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:37.150
the country who will never abandon the president
and 20 percent of the country that will never

00:02:37.150 --> 00:02:39.159
approve of the job the president's doing.

00:02:39.159 --> 00:02:44.270
Meaning, even though on paper a president's
approval could be between zero and 100.

00:02:44.270 --> 00:02:47.319
It's really probably between 20 and 80.

00:02:47.319 --> 00:02:53.920
And when we look at the data over recent times
about do you think Trump really won the election,

00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:58.409
the people who thought even up until January
20th and maybe still today, that somehow Trump

00:02:58.409 --> 00:03:03.500
is going to get a second term, 30 percent
of this country seems basically cuckoo for

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:04.500
Cocoa Puffs.

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:08.269
And I know some people won't like that phrase,
but what I mean is there is a non-trivial

00:03:08.269 --> 00:03:14.000
portion of this country, 25, 30 percent, maybe
that includes that 20 that will never abandon

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:19.720
Trump, plus another five to 10 percent that
thinks they are evaluating the situation and

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:26.680
coming to those same conclusions that is completely
disconnected from reality, completely disconnected

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:31.930
from from empiricism and facts and thinking
and rationality.

00:03:31.930 --> 00:03:38.060
And so when you see, wow, in a country where
25 or 30 percent of the country is whacked,

00:03:38.060 --> 00:03:43.310
81 percent approval on a mask mandate, that
really tells you something.

00:03:43.310 --> 00:03:49.659
These are numbers that are in practice effectively
as close to unanimity as you can expect to

00:03:49.659 --> 00:03:56.830
get in a country that says ideologically,
call it diverse as the United States.

00:03:56.830 --> 00:04:03.040
We also have from this new poll, this ABC
News Ipsos poll, the question of do you believe

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:04.940
Joe Biden will unite the country?

00:04:04.940 --> 00:04:07.700
Now, at the top of the show, I said no.

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:13.030
What I regardless of Joe Biden's efforts,
I don't believe that we will see a United

00:04:13.030 --> 00:04:16.049
United States in any true sense.

00:04:16.049 --> 00:04:22.890
57 percent of respondents believe that Joe
Biden will make progress in uniting the country.

00:04:22.890 --> 00:04:24.930
Not a great number.

00:04:24.930 --> 00:04:29.500
But it's something and we will continue to
track all of this data.

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:34.130
We are starting to see cases now, as I predicted
months ago, this isn't because of anything

00:04:34.130 --> 00:04:35.130
Joe Biden did.

00:04:35.130 --> 00:04:40.810
Yet we are starting to see cases come down
from their pandemic high around January 10th

00:04:40.810 --> 00:04:42.790
and hopefully they will continue on down.

00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:45.130
Hopefully, deaths will turn the corner.

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:47.780
Hospitalizations in many areas are already
going down.

00:04:47.780 --> 00:06:01.500
So let's hope that we continue in this direction

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:02.440
under Joe Biden.

